{"id":"proshchenie","lemma":"прощение","pos":"noun","rank":3144,"glosses":["forgiveness, pardon (forgiveness for an offence)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"прощения","plural":"прощения"},"examples":[{"text":"Ты попросил прощения?","en":"Have you asked for forgiveness?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"попросить"},null]},{"text":"Я прошу за это прощения.","en":"I apologize for this.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"просить"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Прошу прощения, но кто вы?","en":"Excuse me. Who are you?","words":[{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"просить"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"}]},{"text":"Прошу прощения, что так поздно звоню.","en":"I apologize for calling so late.","words":[{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"просить"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"late"},{"g":"to call","l":"звонить"}]},{"text":"Том уже попросил за это прощения.","en":"Tom has already apologized for that.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"попросить"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]}]}